From 30a1123d14b118905bd18536ff647d3c0af68929 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 23 Jul 2021 20:30:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-45031] greco: remove duplicate code

Target is to avoid duplicate code accorss different
greco targets(i.e. arm, arc and arc_elf32). In this
patch many functions common in greco/arm and greco_arc_elf32
implementations are moved to common/common.c.

As preboot_disable_pcie_ltr() needs to be non-static to have common
implementation, relevant change required in relevant gaudi, gaudi2
files too.

Change-Id: I4d50dabf6cd0e9d5de928cd30e58bdc2afced303
Signed-off-by: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
---

